  recap: "Agents are the trifecta's native habitat — autonomy assembles all three legs by default — so secure them by breaking the trifecta structurally (reader/actor separation), sandboxing for blast-radius, least-privilege tools, human hinges on consequential actions, and observability with a kill-switch; good security bounds a successful injection's worst case to something survivable, which is what makes deploying autonomy possible at all.",
